# Integrated Document for Task: Handle Donations

## General Overview of the Project
Develop a web application named 'CharitableGivingPlatform' that enables users to manage and contribute to charitable causes seamlessly using Python and local storage. Note that the website should start from the login page.

## Software Functional Requirements
1. Users shall be able to log in to their accounts on the Login Page by entering a username and password.
2. Users shall be able to view a list of available charities on the Dashboard Page.
3. Users shall be able to navigate to the Charity Details Page to see detailed information about each charity, including its mission and ongoing projects.
4. Users shall be able to view their own contribution history on the Dashboard Page.
5. Users shall be able to donate to a charity by entering a donation amount and clicking the donate button on the Charity Details Page.
6. Users shall be able to log out of their account on the Dashboard Page, returning to the Login Page.
7. Users shall be able to navigate back to the Dashboard from the Charity Details Page using a back button.
8. Users shall be able to select and view detailed information about a specific charity by clicking on a charity��s 'Details' button on the Dashboard Page.

## Data Storage
Data will be stored in local text files. Different types of data will be stored in separate `.txt` files. You should define the text file by yourself in advance. This structured data storage will facilitate easy data retrieval and management through simple file manipulations in Python, ensuring the application remains light and efficient without the need for a SQL database.

## Task Specifics
### Handle Donations
- Implement donation functionality and history tracking.
- Related files: ["main.py", "templates/charity_details.html", "donations.txt"]
}
